# Title: Suspicious Microsoft Office Child Process - MacOS
# ID: 69483748-1525-4a6c-95ca-90dc8d431b68
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
# Date: 2023-01-31
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.persistence, attack.t1059.002, attack.t1137.002, attack.t1204.002
# Description: Detects suspicious child processes spawning from microsoft office suite applications such as word or excel. This could indicates malicious macro execution
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((parent_name:*Microsoft Word* OR parent_name:*Microsoft Excel* OR parent_name:*Microsoft PowerPoint* OR parent_name:*Microsoft OneNote*) AND (process_name:*/bash OR process_name:*/curl OR process_name:*/dash OR process_name:*/fish OR process_name:*/osacompile OR process_name:*/osascript OR process_name:*/sh OR process_name:*/zsh OR process_name:*/python OR process_name:*/python3 OR process_name:*/wget))
